# Release archives live in the GitHub Releases, not in the repo
*.rar
*.zip

# Build artifacts (.NET / MSBuild)
bin/
obj/
*.csproj.lscache
*.user
.vs/

# Stale build output left at a project root
Doriathprogressive/ProgressiveMod.dll

# Personal and working files, unrelated to the mods' code
notes/
action.md
AGENTS.md
CONTEXT.md
AIDirector_Notes.md
AIDirectorConfigRule_Explained.md
TESTS.md
recap.txt
conversation.txt
Logout.txt
correction*.txt
Untitled*.png
New folder/

# Dead sources, kept locally but not shipped
*.cs.old
Doriathprogressive/FreeThingsOnLastMoveAndCrit2Rule.cs
Doriathprogressive/HouseRulesUiGameVrProgressivePerks.cs
Doriathpointprogressive/PieceProgressLostRule.cs

# Superseded by the root README and this file — safe to delete locally
Doriathprogressive/README.md
Doriathpointprogressive/README.md
Doriath.Common/README.md
Doriathprogressive/.gitignore
Doriathpointprogressive/.gitignore
